3322
02:05:08.340 --> 02:05:11.130
And so interesting, and they, I'm sure they both were on

3323
02:05:11.130 --> 02:05:13.350
these training programs and they were on

3324
02:05:13.350 --> 02:05:14.820
performance kind of based.

