3334
02:05:35.810 --> 02:05:37.009
Right, right, right.

3335
02:05:37.009 --> 02:05:38.190
You know, which is weird.

3336
02:05:38.190 --> 02:05:40.110
And it's my furthest swim I've done in the ocean

3337
02:05:40.110 --> 02:05:43.290
since, you know, I did the 5K swim a couple years ago,

3338
02:05:43.290 --> 02:05:45.963
so it's like maybe three years ago.

3339
02:05:45.963 --> 02:05:47.540
So it was great.

3340
02:05:47.540 --> 02:05:49.980
And so that's a great piece of advice.

3341
02:05:49.980 --> 02:05:52.410
I think, in terms of pulling yourself away

3342
02:05:52.410 --> 02:05:54.660
from family and friends, I wouldn't put like,

3343
02:05:54.660 --> 02:05:58.260
I mean you're 27, I wouldn't put that guilt on you,

3344
02:05:58.260 --> 02:06:00.011
