3346
02:06:02.040 --> 02:06:03.630
that are like having a lot of fun at night

3347
02:06:03.630 --> 02:06:05.370
and you have to get some sleep cause you're running

3348
02:06:05.370 --> 02:06:06.203
early in the morning.

3349
02:06:06.203 --> 02:06:08.130
Maybe that's where that's coming from.

3350
02:06:08.130 --> 02:06:11.280
