3351
02:06:11.280 --> 02:06:14.580
Like, and it's okay. Like I think the beauty of escape

3352
02:06:14.580 --> 02:06:17.700
is a wonderful thing I've lived many times.

3353
02:06:17.700 --> 02:06:19.683
As a Jew, it's in our nature.

3354
02:06:20.610 --> 02:06:22.290
But no, but all seriousness,

3355
02:06:22.290 --> 02:06:26.100
like the idea of dropping out and going for a long travel

3356
02:06:26.100 --> 02:06:28.290
or getting out in the ocean and forgetting everything

3357
02:06:28.290 --> 02:06:30.390
for two hours or going for a long run,

3358
02:06:30.390 --> 02:06:32.430
I think there's a lot to be said for that.

3359
02:06:32.430 --> 02:06:37.050
So I wouldn't feel bad about that, pulling yourself away.

3360
02:06:37.050 --> 02:06:40.140
It's what I do now is kind of take bite size moments

3361
02:06:40.140 --> 02:06:41.580
like that if I can.

3362
02:06:41.580 --> 02:06:44.610
It's the only time I'm not either working or spending time

3363
02:06:44.610 --> 02:06:47.240
kind of help, you know, with the family and all that.

3364
02:06:47.240 --> 02:06:49.710
We need that, especially Americans

3365
02:06:49.710 --> 02:06:52.140
and the individualist society that we are in.

3366
02:06:52.140 --> 02:06:54.480
I find myself needing that time

3367
02:06:54.480 --> 02:06:56.910
and it's the best way for me to take time

3368
02:06:56.910 --> 02:06:59.670
that's also fueling my wellbeing,

3369
02:06:59.670 --> 02:07:01.620
which only helps me work harder

3370
02:07:01.620 --> 02:07:02.970
and be better with my family.

3371
02:07:02.970 --> 02:07:06.035
So all that kind of stuff, I don't look at it

3372
02:07:06.035 --> 02:07:07.800
as pulling myself away,

3373
02:07:07.800 --> 02:07:11.400
I look at it as needed time to recharge.

3374
02:07:11.400 --> 02:07:13.830
And so that's the only thing I would say to the question

3375
02:07:13.830 --> 02:07:16.020
that I disagree with, but I think your point

3376
02:07:16.020 --> 02:07:18.767
to like bringing the joy back is really cool.

3377
02:07:18.767 --> 02:07:21.570
Yeah. I mean I think rather than framing it

3378
02:07:21.570 --> 02:07:26.350
as an escape versus being plugged in, think of it as

3379
02:07:29.460 --> 02:07:31.470
nourishment versus depletion.

3380
02:07:31.470 --> 02:07:34.110
Like are you being nourished by these training sessions

3381
02:07:34.110 --> 02:07:35.070
or are they depleting you?

3382
02:07:35.070 --> 02:07:37.710
If you're training for a hardcore goal,

3383
02:07:37.710 --> 02:07:38.730
you're gonna get depleted,

3384
02:07:38.730 --> 02:07:42.510
like you're gonna be pushed and challenged and that's okay.

3385
02:07:42.510 --> 02:07:44.520
That's part of the whole deal, right?

3386
02:07:44.520 --> 02:07:46.920
And there's something to be gleaned and learned

3387
02:07:46.920 --> 02:07:48.780
about yourself from that experience,

3388
02:07:48.780 --> 02:07:51.429
and this is part of why we sign up to do hard things.

3389
02:07:51.429 --> 02:07:52.262
Yeah.

3390
02:07:52.262 --> 02:07:53.850
But ultimately in the long run,

3391
02:07:53.850 --> 02:07:56.250
it has to be more nourishing than depleting,

3392
02:07:56.250 --> 02:07:58.020
and whether that means you take breaks

3393
02:07:58.020 --> 02:08:01.320
or you find ways to build into whatever it is

3394
02:08:01.320 --> 02:08:04.290
that you're pursuing, that nourishment piece,

3395
02:08:04.290 --> 02:08:07.530
be it through community or through a relaxation

3396
02:08:07.530 --> 02:08:10.440
of the pressure that you're putting on yourself, et cetera,

3397
02:08:10.440 --> 02:08:12.900
getting immersed in nature or just finding a way

3398
02:08:12.900 --> 02:08:17.900
to make it fun, gamifying it somehow, that's critical,

3399
02:08:18.060 --> 02:08:20.460
even if you might, in the micro,

3400
02:08:20.460 --> 02:08:23.610
