3401
02:08:23.610 --> 02:08:25.170
that you're seeking because it's not

3402
02:08:25.170 --> 02:08:26.550
part of the training program.

3403
02:08:26.550 --> 02:08:27.383
Right. Right, right, right.

3404
02:08:27.383 --> 02:08:30.570
Ultimately it's going to, you know,

3405
02:08:30.570 --> 02:08:33.570
build longevity by creating that, you know,

3406
02:08:33.570 --> 02:08:38.370
deeper kind of emotional connection with this thing.

3407
02:08:38.370 --> 02:08:40.200
And your motivations for these efforts change.

3408
02:08:40.200 --> 02:08:42.060
It's gonna change. You're gonna evolve, you're gonna grow,

3409
02:08:42.060 --> 02:08:44.190
