3411
02:08:46.563 --> 02:08:50.460
It's like we said earlier, this seasonal aspect of living.

3412
02:08:50.460 --> 02:08:53.460
That's just the way it is. And so we embrace that,

3413
02:08:53.460 --> 02:08:56.430
We embrace that these motivations are going to change,

3414
02:08:56.430 --> 02:08:58.770
